SUMMARY:Toronto West End Park Meet-Up - by For Our Kids
LOCATION:High Park Wading Pool
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.forourkids.ca/toronto_westend_park_meet_up_september2026_2026
 0912?\n\nHosted by For Our Kids (https://www.forourkids.ca/)\n\nWelcome to
  the first ever west end Toronto For Our Kids parents\, caregivers\, kids
  and allies meet-up/drop-in at High Park. Connect with other
  parents/caregivers and to share thoughts about current climate concerns
  and ideas for actions/campaigns. Free snacks - bring your kids!
