SUMMARY:Cyclists Aren't Secondary - by Cycle Toronto
LOCATION:Tom Riley Park
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.cycleto.ca/cyclists_arent_secondary\n\nHosted by Cycle
  Toronto (https://www.cycleto.ca)\n\nAs the province continues to move
  forward with its plan to remove 19 km of protected bike lanes\, including
  sections in Etobicoke to be done "immediately"\, cycling advocates are
  inviting Premier Ford and Minister Sarkaria on a bike ride along the side
  streets and so-called "secondary roads" that would ostensibly replace the
  Bloor St W protected bike lanes.
END:VEVENT
