SUMMARY:Toronto Disability Pride March - by Toronto Disability Pride March
LOCATION:Queens Park
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://torontodisabilitypride.wordpress.com/2026/07/31/celebrate-15-year
 s-of-toronto-disability-pride-march/\n\nHosted by Toronto Disability Pride
  March (http://tdpm.org/)\n\nAs disability justice continues to gain
  social capital\, and disability language starts to be co-opted\,
  authentic visibility and lived experience are more needed than ever.
  Please join TDPM as they take to the streets and celebrate 15 years of
  resistance\, rage\, joy\, celebration\, and survival. 
END:VEVENT
