DESCRIPTION:Special Sunday Tourist Ride in honour of Alan Gordon Alan Gord
 on was a former TBN member and champion for the Leisure Wheeler program. Y
 ou can read his tribute here . He strived to make cycling inclusive for ev
 eryone and after his passing in 2002\, the Alan Gordon Memorial Rides in S
 eptember where cyclists of all levels are given the opportunity to ride in
  a group and strive for distances they may not have covered before. This r
 ide is a Tourist Class ride for 105 km in Alan's honour\, and part of a sp
 ecial day of Alan Gordon rides where we hope to see TBN jerseys everywhere
  on streets and trails from Toronto to Burlington! This tourist class ride
  route has common sections with the UR and LW Al...
