UID:eba2f3df1cee75503289920732a9c8ba@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Arrive at 9:00 AM\, 15 minutes before the start of the ride so
  that you will not keep your group waiting. Unfortunately Line 2 - Broadvi
 ew to St. George will be closed until 11:00 AM! Alan Gordon Memorial Ride 
 to Port Credit This is our longest ride of the year. Note the earlier star
 t time. The ride is a memorial to Alan Gordon who\, in 1995\, created the 
 Leisure Wheeler category\, designed the rides and led them. In the year 20
 00 he and Eileen Harbinson designed a metric century for the Leisure Wheel
 ers. This year\, we have shortened the ride. The route will take us on the
  new Don Trail which skirts the beautiful new Biidaasige Park on the way t
 o Cherry St. Bring a picnic lunch to eat by the lak...
