SUMMARY:How to Reject the Logics of Terrorism - by Al-Ahrar Palestinian
  Prisoner Support
LOCATION:Available upon registration
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://cryptpad.fr/form/#/2/form/view/PEw4xGwnWlK82q7v7bCXCnZrSbDNuTBbFk
 7QapxzXHs/\n\nHosted by Al-Ahrar Palestinian Prisoner Support
  (https://alahrartoronto.org/)\n\nThe label of "terrorist" is being
  applied more and more broadly to describe anyone taking action against
  genocide. This workshop will break down how the construct of "terrorism"
  is used to disrupt movements and explore practical ways to fight back.
  The goal of the state's terror-tactics is to generate fear and anxiety.
  Come disarm that through learning and conversation!
END:VEVENT
