SUMMARY:Lunette at TIFF
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260914T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T000000
UID:evt-ZJRXIdA5QKGLfoe@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nJoin Lunette F
 ilms for a special gathering at TIFF to celebrate our six month anniversar
 y 🎉\n\n This evening is an occasion to slow down amid the busy week\, c
 atch up with friends\, and buy a drink or two!\n\nWe’re also celebrating
  the World Premiere of Yung Chang’s The Highway at TIFF. Yung Chang\, on
 e of Canada’s most prominent documentary filmmakers\, makes a haunting n
 arrative debut with this visually arresting\, atmospheric slow-burner abou
 t an affluent businesswoman whose cushy routine and sense of reality unrav
 el after she drives past the aftermath of a hit and run. The Highway scree
 ns on…\n\nHosted by Malkah Manouel
LOCATION:https://luma.com/event/evt-ZJRXIdA5QKGLfoe
URL:https://luma.com/ixeoitf1
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
