DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T113000
UID:6aa06f6eac72f22c5568ac2e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us as author Catherine Little reads her book\nAnne of the
  Library-on-the-Hill.\nThe reading will be followed by a Q&A and a craft.\
 nAbout the book:\nGrowing up in the shadow of the Great War\, Anne finds c
 omfort in her neighbourhood library\, where she loses herself in books\, o
 ften imagining herself as part of the story. She particularly loves the bo
 oks of LM Montgomery — and her imagination really takes off when she lea
 rns her beloved author is in town.\nFor kindergarten and school-aged child
 ren. Registration not required.
LOCATION:City Hall
