SUMMARY:No Cuts to Care Webinar and Phone Zap - by No Cuts to Care
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/Dcy81dtlGR2/\n\nHosted
  by No Cuts to Care
  (https://www.instagram.com/no.cuts.to.care/)\n\nHealthcare providers and
  community members are already seeing the costly harms of the government's
  cuts to refugee health care. Hear updates from health care workers about
  real stories of harm of the past four months\, followed by a phone zap to
  urge the government to reverse harmful cuts to care.
END:VEVENT
