DESCRIPTION:Modern mobile smartphones come equipped with powerful cameras.
  They can be used to take photos of family or friends\, record video of an
  activity or hobby\, and even pursue any professional interests.\nJoin us 
 to learn how to frame your shots\, hidden settings in your camera app\, ma
 nage lighting\, and more to help you maximize your smartphone camera.\nThi
 s is an in-person event intended for ages 13+. Drop-in\, no registration r
 equired.\n*Please bring your own smartphone.
