DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T190000
UID:6a839f4fb204780029939602@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover how the mBot2 uses sensors to detect its surroundings
  and respond to what it finds. Learners build their coding skills while ex
 perimenting with sensors\, movement\, and robot reactions. Students will l
 earn appropriate coding blocks\, how to add program extensions\, how to mo
 ve their robot and detect an obtacle.  Time will be given to learn and te
 st their coding skills.\nDetails:  Patrons aged 13+\, Basic mouse and key
