SUMMARY:Buying a Car? Know Your Rights!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T190000
UID:6a46b8ad296ea565de303709@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Buying a vehicle can be a challenging experience with long-te
 rm financial implications.\nJoin us for an online presentation by the\nOnt
 ario Motor Vehicle Industry Council (OMVIC)\n\, the regulator of motor veh
 icle sales in Ontario. A representative from OMVIC will provide you with 
 resources and tips for buying new and used cars in Ontario.\nTopics will i
 nclude:\nOMVIC’s Compensation Fund\nUnderstanding Car Dealer Advertising
 \nNegative Equity & Long Term Loans\nAgreement & Disclosure\nAvoiding Curb
 sides & Fraud Prevention\nTips for Buying or Leasing a Car\nRegistration:\
 nThis virtual Zoom event is free to join. Once registered\, you’ll recei
 ve an email with the Zoom link.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJoining and part
 icipating in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nInformation Collec
 tion Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the To
 ronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(
 c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program re
 gistration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library hand
 les your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tp
 l.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a46b8ad296ea565de303709
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
