SUMMARY:Civic Meetup: Bill C-22 and Lawful Access - by Civic Tech Toronto
LOCATION:Hybrid
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-560-unnecessary-0wipnh\n\nHosted
  by Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nHear from Cynthia Khoo\,
  a technology and human rights lawyer based in Toronto\, and a Senior
  Fellow at the Citizen Lab\, about the privacy and human rights
  implications of Bill C-22 and especially how it will impact marginalized
  groups. Followed by breakout groups. 
END:VEVENT
