SUMMARY:Launch of Thinking from Black: A Lexicon - by Another Story
  Bookshop
LOCATION:Innis Town Hall
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/launch-of-thinking-from-black-a-lexicon-ticke
 ts-1997087224649\n\nHosted by Another Story Bookshop
  (https://anotherstory.ca/home)\n\nAnother Story\, CRC in Black Studies in
  the Humanities at York U\, the Department of English at U of T\, and
  Alchemy by Knopf present the launch of The Practicing Refusal
  Collective's Thinking From Black: A Lexicon.
