CREATED:20260910T063811Z
DTSTART:20260915T230000Z
DTEND:20260916T003000Z
SUMMARY:The Damage of De-risking: ICLMG report launch - by International
  Civil Liberties Monitoring Group
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://iclmg.ca/de-risking-launch\n\nHosted by
  International Civil Liberties Monitoring Group
  (https://iclmg.ca/)\n\nDe-risking is where financial institutions
  restrict access to the financial system for organizations that are deemed
  "risky"\, which has harmed numerous non-profit groups across Canada\,
  particularly those active in Muslim communities or providing humanitarian
  aid abroad. A new report shows that these decisions are the result of
  Canada's anti-terrorist financing system and its inherent biases. 
END:VEVENT
