DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization. This month\, we will be hosting\nJVS Toronto\n\, 
 a non-profit organization offering a range of job search support and emplo
 yment services\, including employment counselling\, training\, mentoring\,
  job coaching\, and job retention in Toronto\, Markham and across the GTA.
 \nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient li
 sts will be available at the program.
