 ll explore the fundamentals of 3D Design using a browser-based program\, w
 hile completing a project. This is an in person event\, no prior design ex
 perience is necessary.\nAttendants must pre-register a Tinkercad account 
 in tinkercad.com\, or have a google account\, apple account or facebook 
 account to log into the Tinkercad.\nRegistration required. Intended for ag
 es 13+. Each Child under 12 years old must accompany an adult. For safety
  reasons\, no child under 6 years old will be allowed in this class.\nInfo
 rmation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is colle
 cted by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sectio
 ns 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event 
