SUMMARY:Seniors E-Connect
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T170000
UID:69c2b59cb2f5bfe57aba151b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you 55 or older and want to get more comfortable with your
  phone\, tablet\, or laptop?\nSeniors E-Connect will help you learn tech t
 opics in a fun group setting\, but with the one-on-one help of a teen volu
 nteer under the guidance of library staff.\nPlease bring your own personal
  device.\nIf you're a teen between the ages of 13-17 and would like to lea
 rn more about becoming a Seniors E-Connect volunteer\, visit the\nSeniors 
