SUMMARY:Introduction to Ancient and Modern Cosmology with Dr. Ting Li
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T193000
UID:6a7ba10a5d8bc300315a1190@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Astronomy Day with Fort York!\nDr. Ting Li (Dunlap I
 nstitute\, University of Toronto) will be joining us to give a talk on An
 cient and Modern Cosmology. Through this talk you will gain an understandi
 ng of cosmology\, both ancient and modern. We will explore the history of 
 how humans have sought to explain the origins and structure of the univers
 e\, from ancient myths to modern scientific theories. Join us to learn abo
 ut the latest discoveries and theories in cosmology\, including dark matte
 r\, dark energy\, and the big bang.\nDrop-in. First come\, first served.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7ba10a5d8bc300315a1190
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
