 ic: Opening Social\nCome hang out with Toronto’s  builders\, founders\, 
 business leaders\, decision-makers\, marketers\, developers\, AI practitio
 ners\, and other curious humans building with Agentic AI tools\, or trying
  to figure out where to begin.\nWe’ll be swapping ideas about tools like
  Hermes\, OpenClaw\, ChatGPT\, Codex\, Claude\, Scout\, Zo\, and whatever 
 else people are experimenting with.\nThis is a casual summer social built 
 around great conversation\, good company\, sunshine\, and a brew or two\, 
 or whatever you prefer. Drop in\, grab a drink\, meet interesting people\,
  and talk about what…\n\nHosted by Melissa Cutler & Sarah Gulino
