DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCampbell House Museum\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nJoin 
 us for the opening  night of JOURNEY OF THE MIND at Campbell House Museum\
 , Toronto.\nBringing together contemporary figurative and abstract works a
 longside short films\, the exhibition explores the nature of the mind – 
 how it wanders\, what obstructs it and how it can return to clarity. Throu
 gh this exploration\, it offers practical insight into inner steadiness\, 
 purposeful living and peace.\nOn the evening:\nGuided Simran (a practice o
 f stillness and deep listening)\nExhibition walkthroughs\nMeet the without
  SHAPE without FORM team\nComplimentary food and refreshments\nAbout the e
 xhibition\nWe…\n\nHosted by without SHAPE without FORM
LOCATION:Campbell House Museum\, 160 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M5H 3H3\, C
 anada
