DESCRIPTION:Want to learn an instrument? Try learning to play with ukulele
 . We provide the uke\, and you can come with an open mind. Ukulele for Beg
 inners is a series of 3 classes. Attendees should attend all three classes
 \, (Sept 3\, 10 & 17) which will cover fundamentals of ukulele playing:
  the parts of a ukulele\, tuning\, strumming patterns\, and some basic cho
 rds.\nPlease register\, if you need to borrow a ukulele for this session.\
 nIf you have your own instrument\, you may drop-in\, no registration neede
