SUMMARY:LSP: Be one step ahead: Financial Benefits and Free Services for N
 ewcomers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260917T191500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260917T201500
UID:6a8effca69166f088b94ff48@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A free workshop to learn about:\n- government benefits (e.g. f
 amily\, retirement\, etc.) applicable to you\n- free services and programs
  for newcomers\n-helpful information on how to access these services\nFor 
 more information and to register\, contact LSP Program Worker Shane at 416
 -931-6536 or saquinoculturelink.ca\nYou can join\nonline\nvia Zoom or\nin 
 person\nat 430 Burnhamthorpe Rd\, Etobicoke\, ON\, M9B 2B1\nIn partnership
  with Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, CultureLink Settleme
