DESCRIPTION:Today we will go in the OPPOSITE DIRECTION to add some variety
  into our ride. Please ensure you have downloaded the new reverse version 
 of the route below. Meet at Hornby Park to ride up the Niagara Escarpment 
 to Rockwood. The old way into the park is now blocked. Coming from Toronto
  along Steeles Ave\, turn left at the traffic light at Hornby Rd into the 
 area that is under construction. Follow around to the lower parking area a
 t the ball diamond. See the picture below. Distances: 61km (no food/coffee
 /washroom stop after 15 km)\, 74km (Preferred - lunch in Rockwood)\, and 9
 0km (lunch options Rockwood or Arkell). This is a Tourist level ride. If y
 ou are uncertain whether this level is appropriat...
