DESCRIPTION:Experience the transformative power of writing in an inclusive
  space!\nWriters Collective of Canada (WCC) workshops are unlike any other
 . We\n write together\, share first drafts in an encouraging environment\,
  \nlisten deeply to one another\, and receive supportive feedback. Tap int
 o \nyour story and explore your voice in an environment of dignity\, coura
 ge\,\n and respect. (wcc-cec.org)\nNo experience required. Beginners are w
 elcome. Materials are provided.\nWorkshops are not sequential\; every work
 shop is unique - join any session and let's write together!\nSpace is limi
 ted\n. Register online or in-branch by calling 416-396-8939.
