 ative projects\, workshops\, and community initiatives rooted in care\, le
 adership\, and collective growth.\nJoin us as we celebrate the people\, st
 ories\, and impact that have shaped the Community Impact Program.\nThe eve
 ning will feature an Awards Ceremony\, a Community Gallery Wall showcasing
