SUMMARY:Music on the River- ft. Blk Orchid
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJam wit
 h us in ours boats to Blk Orchid's tunes! To book your spot\, please go to
  the link:\n*[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-t
 he-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-
 river/)*\nLink shows live boat availability and options!\n\nLocated on Tor
 onto’s beautiful Humber River our Music On The River event starts at our
  Humber Paddling centre which is only a 5-Minute walk from Old Mill TTC St
 ation! Upon arrival we’ll get you signed in and set you up with your boa
 t and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of the meandering 
 Humber River before enjoying a 45-Minute set from Popular Local Toronto Ar
 tists!\n\n***Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our co
 ntrol. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let you know as soon as
  possible.***\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://torontoadventures.ca/a
 ll-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-
 adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/)\nSingle Kayak (seats 1 person) : $49
 .95 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (
 seats 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +ta
 xes\nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nSeat in a Voyageur C
 anoe (1 person) : $39.95 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat (boat/equipment): $9.
 95 +taxes\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s) “L
 ifejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Our experienced staff to
  help you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the 
 weather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all recommended for sunny 
 days!\n* We recommend securely fastened footwear (footwear is not required
  for SUPs).\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the show\n* Snacks & Drinks
  (Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget your Cameras!\n\n**[Google Link Directi
 ons](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocation)**\n**[C
 ancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**[ ](h
 ttps://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)\n\nWe hope to see you out o
 n the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/315255799/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260614T150403Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260614T150403Z
