DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nCTRL+SHIFT is 
 back for Vol. XIV\, this time at Ambition's new space!\nThink of this one 
 as a director's cut. We're not talking about polished final versions\, but
  the one with the process left in\nShort talks covering the full spectrum\
 , from deeply technical to highly creative and practical\, including voice
  models and realtime AI\, virtual production\, generative pipelines\, and 
 creative software.\nNo sales pitches.\nLeave with something you learned. T
 hat's the mandate for the night\, and it fits what Ambition is building.\n
 Speakers announced soon.\nDoors at 7:00\, talks around 7:30. Drinks\, demo
 s\, and…\n\nHosted by Josh Maldonado & 3 others
