DESCRIPTION:Address:\nAllan Gardens\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nVenus Fest is
  turning 10 this year!\nWith our yearly programming\, join us for the firs
 t night of live music. Sounds by PYNE\, LAL & Prado Monroe\n\n+ Live ASL I
 nterpretation by Phoenix The Fire\n+ Live Visuals by Tara Morris\n+ Visual
  Art by Aedan Corey\n+ Interactive Installation by Christina Dovolis\n\n+ 
 Drop-In Mahjong by All-Flowers Mahjong\n+ Market by Kabuté & Friends\, in
  Collaboration w/ Friends of Allan Gardens\n\nwww.venusfest.net\n—\nPYNE
 \nAlanna Stuart (pka PYNE) is Caribbean-Canadian music artist-scholar. In 
 sound and scholarship\, she is in the thick of what she dubs a ‘Femmehal
 l’ praxis:…\n\nHosted by Venus Fest
LOCATION:Allan Gardens\, 160 Gerrard St E\, Toronto\, ON M5A 2E5\, Canada
