DESCRIPTION:For people who have basic internet skills   but want to learn 
 about online safety and privacy. We will cover tips for   creating secure 
 passwords\, using public Wi-Fi safely\, protecting your device   from malw
 are\, and how to recognize online scams. Resource handout provided.
