SUMMARY:How to Knock on Doors for a Candidate: West End - by Progress
  Toronto
LOCATION:Available upon registration (west end)
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.progresstoronto.ca/election-training-series-sep-19-2026\n\nHo
 sted by Progress Toronto (https://www.progresstoronto.ca/)\n\nDoor
  knocking (also known as canvassing) is a crucial part of a winning
  strategy for progressive campaigns. Face-to-face conversations are a
  powerful way to reach people and move them to vote for your candidate.
  This in-person workshop with community organizers will teach you the
  basics of door knocking\, followed by a real-life canvassing session.
