DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nFall is on its
  way and we're celebrating how we know best - with a table full of good te
 a\, good food\, and good company!\nWe've been dreaming up our first event 
 and are so excited to finally share it with you ☺️\nIt'll be an intima
 te gathering focused around abundance and introspection as we approach the
  fall equinox. Think warm conversation\, full plates that celebrate the se
 ason\, and the simple pleasure of sharing tea together. We want to open th
 e space for you to slow down\, chat\, and connect with the people around y
 ou.\n\nYour ticket includes:\nWelcome drink\nCharcuterie\nFull spread of t
 ea…\n\nHosted by Baked & Brewed & High Tea Heritage Co.
