SUMMARY:Democratic Socialists of Canada: Orientation - by Democratic
  Socialists of Canada
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.democraticsocialists.ca/orientation_20260921\n\nHosted by
  Democratic Socialists of Canada
  (https://www.democraticsocialists.ca)\n\nIn this one-hour session\, you
  will listen to a brief presentation outlining the DSC's mission\,
  structure\, and activities\, and learn how to get involved in your local
  Chapter and/or on a National level. Following the presentation\, there
  will be a discussion period and the organizers will answer any questions
  you may have.
