X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Toronto Ai Machine Learning Data Science": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-ai-machine-learning-data-science/events/316064310/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_toronto_ai_machine_learning_data_science
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto AI & ML
UID:event_316064310@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043605Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260922T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260922T140000
SUMMARY:Sept 22 - FiftyOne Agent: Automate Visual AI Workflows with Natura
 l Language
DESCRIPTION:Toronto AI\, Machine Learning and Computer Vision Meetup\nLear
 n about FiftyOne Agent\, an AI assistant built directly into FiftyOne that
  turns plain-language requests into real dataset operations.\n\n**Date\, T
 ime and Location**\n\nSep 22\, 2026\n9:00 AM - 10:00 AM Pacific\nOnline. *
 *[Register for the Zoom!](https://voxel51.com/events/meet-the-fiftyone-age
 nt-automate-visual-ai-workflows-with-natural-language-september-22-2026)**
 \n\nAsk it to find and remove duplicate images\, run object detection and 
 surface low-confidence predictions\, or evaluate a model and summarize whe
 re it fails\, and the agent handles execution end to end.\n\nWe will also 
 walk through the newest capabilities shipping with this release\, includin
 g code generation and plugin generation. You will see how to go from a con
 versational prompt to a custom dashboard\, visualization\, or full FiftyOn
 e application\, and how to package multi-step workflows as reusable skills
  the agent can call on demand.\n\nBecause the agent runs inside FiftyOne's
  secure guardrails\, teams keep full control. Connect your preferred model
 s from over 100 LLM providers\, route requests through your own enterprise
  gateway\, and maintain audit logging and user attribution for every actio
 n the agent takes.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-ai-machine-learning-data-scie
 nce/events/316064310/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260810T210828Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260810T210828Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
