SUMMARY:Tracing the Impacts of Alberta's Anti-Trans+ Legislation on Youth
  and their Families - by Egale Canada
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://egale-ca.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_x11j3OifQjSyDJxo3G_JRg#/regi
 stration\n\nHosted by Egale Canada (https://egale.ca/)\n\nIn this
  presentation\, Leah Hamilton (she/her) and Corinne L. Mason (they/them)
  will share their findings from a research project investigating the
  impacts of Alberta legislation banning access to gender affirming
  healthcare for youth\, limiting inclusive education\, and excluding
  transgender girls and women from ‘female only’ sports.
END:VEVENT
