DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nLet's hang!\nJ
 oin the Toronto founder community to connect with other founders and hear 
 stories from a founder who went through the wringer and came out the other
  side.\nMeet Noura Sakkijha\, Co-Founder and CEO of Mejuri\,\nJoin Noura S
 akkijha\, Co-Founder and CEO of Mejuri\, as she sits down with Elizabeth Y
 in\, General Partner at Hustle Fund for a conversation on what it really t
 akes to build a category-defining brand from scratch. They dig into the st
 ory behind Mejuri's rise\, from a crowdsourced side-project in 2013 to a $
 100M+ direct-to-consumer jewelry brand worn by the likes of Selena Gomez a
 nd…\n\nHosted by Hustle Fund
