 ne-workshop-tickets-2000044529026\n\nHosted by Toronto Zine Library
  (https://www.instagram.com/torontozinelibrary/)\n\nBack by popular
  demand\, the TZL presents “Summer 2026 in Ephemera”\, a junk
  journaling & complilation zinemaking workshop. Come on down to the
  Tranzac with your mementos of summer (letters\, notes\, ticket subs\,
  receipts) and create a time capsule zine together.
END:VEVENT
