SUMMARY:Barbara Frum Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260923T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260923T193000
UID:69611a202c65973d0016d93a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively discussion about the selected book of the
  month in a welcoming and friendly space. Everyone is welcome. Get your ph
 ysical copy in-branch at the Reference Desk or borrow an eBook/eAudiobook 
 copy by downloading the Libby app on your mobile device or tablet.\nRegist
 er to receive email reminders about upcoming book club dates.\nJuly 26 -\n
