SUMMARY:Anti-Networking Fall Social
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T193000
UID:evt-NzuQD4y4dqoOSH6@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nWatson's\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nSummer is over\, a
 nd it's getting chilly. \n\nBut before we all start cancelling plans becau
 se it is too cold\, we have one more reason to get out. 👀\nThe city sti
 ll has some life in it\, and we think that is a good enough reason to get 
 a room full of people together again. ✌️\nAnti-Networking is for peopl
 e who want to meet new people without it feeling transactional.\nThis is a
  room for better conversations\, unexpected connections\, and relationship
 s worth nurturing.\nBest for people who are:\nWorking remotely and need a 
 reason to leave the house\nNew to Toronto and trying to find their circle\
 nCurious…\n\nHosted by Anti-Networking
LOCATION:Watson's\, 398 Richmond St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 1X6\, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/hnfr1iix
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
