DESCRIPTION:Address:\nLassonde Art Trail\nPlease meet in front of Old Fire
  Hall 30\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nJoin us for the Autumn edition of our 'W
 ellbeing Walks' series where each season we invite an artist to create an 
 engaging experience that explores the interconnectedness of the wellbeing 
 of self with the wellbeing of the natural world.\nRiver Resonances by Trev
 a Legassie is a soundwalk that will invite participants to collectively an
 d individually attune to the acoustic environment of Biidaasige Park. Part
 icipants will be gifted a series of listening scores on postcards\, compos
 ed for the Lassonde Art Trail\, that together illustrate the meandering tr
 ajectory of the newly constructed river…\n\nHosted by Niki
LOCATION:Lassonde Art Trail\, 39 Commissioners St\, Toronto\, ON M5A 1A6\,
  Canada
