DESCRIPTION:Drop-in on the last Thursday of the month for a lively book di
 scussion led by a librarian!\nRegular and Large Print copies of September
 's selection\,\nAll's Well\nby Mona Awad\, are now available to pick up fr
 om the first floor reference desk.\nThis title is also available in Large 
 Print\, as an eBook\, and as an eAudiobook.\nUpcoming Titles:\nSeptember 2
 4 - All's Well by Mona Awad\nOctober 29 - Prairie Edge by Conor Kerr\nNov
 ember 26 - The Lion Women of Tehran by Marjan Kamali\nJanuary 28 - To Be A
 nnounced\nFebruary 25 - Encampment by Maggie Helwig\nMarch 25 - The Tainte
 d Cup by Robert Jackson Bennett
