BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Wildernessunion": "https://www.meetup.com/wildernessunion/events/315976023/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_wildernessunion
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Wilderness Union
UID:event_315976023@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043614Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T063000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260927T190000
SUMMARY:Canoe Camping in Killarney 2
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/killarney-camping-2)**\n\n
 **Dive into the Killarney backcountry with this beautiful and beginner fri
 endly canoe camping adventure.**\n\nWe're heading to Bell Lake\, on the qu
 ieter east side of the park\, for a weekend that mixes an easy paddle-in c
 amping trip and an incredible hike to Silver Peak\, the highest point in K
 illarney.\n\nFriday\, we'll paddle the short 2.5km crossing to our backcou
 ntry site\, set up camp\, and spend the afternoon settling in. The rest of
  the afternoon is yours to spend how you like. If you want to learn to pit
 ch a tent\, get a fire going properly\, or handle a canoe\, we'll show you
 . If you'd rather find a rock in the sun and do nothing\, that works too.\
 n\nSaturday\, you can chill around camp or paddle over and hike Silver Pea
 k\, the highest point in the park. It's a roughly 11km round trip\, starti
 ng on an easy rolling trail before a steep\, hands on scramble up exposed 
 quartzite for the final push. At the top\, you're rewarded with a 360 degr
 ee view over Killarney's white ridges and out to Georgian Bay. Trust us\, 
 you won’t get many views in Ontario that are better than this!\n\nBoth n
 ights\, we'll eat around the fire and fall asleep under some of the cleare
 st skies in Ontario. Killarney's stargazing is genuinely other-worldly. On
  a clear night you'll see the Milky Way and more stars than you knew exist
 ed. Sunday\, we pack up and paddle back out.\n\nBy Sunday\, you'll have sp
 ent two days swimming\, paddling\, and sleeping under the stars\, surround
 ed by Killarney's unmistakable landscapes.\n\nWhat's included\n\n* Profess
 ional & certified guides\n* ‍All camp meals\, cooking equipment and mess
  kits\n* ‍Tents\n* Canoe rentals\n\nSleeping bags and sleep pads can be 
 rented from WU for a small fee.\n\n**Highlights**\n**Silver Peak Summit:**
  The highest point in Killarney\, with sweeping views over the range and o
 ut to Georgian Bay\n**Stargazing:** With some of the darkest skies in Onta
 rio\, the Milky Way is in full view on a clear night\n**Lake Swimming:** C
 ool off in clear water\, or take the canoe out for a closer look at the sh
 oreline\n\n**Event cost: $455+HST (for explorer members) - $70 optional tr
 ansport available.**\n**Register [here.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/a
 dventures/killarney-camping-2)**\n\n**About Wilderness Union**\nWilderness
  Union is deliberate about building an outdoors community that connects yo
 u to the life-changing magic of the outdoors and helps you find your peopl
 e.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 years old. The group is a mix of GTA locals
  and newcomers to Toronto from within Canada and abroad.\n\nAttendance num
 bers on Meetup don't reflect our actual event attendance - we typically ha
 ve 15-20 community members at each event. Large enough that there's someon
 e new to meet but small enough that it's not overwhelming!\n\n***Learn mor
 e at our website [www.wildernessunion.com](https://www.wildernessunion.com
 /)***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/wildernessunion/events/315976023/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260804T161241Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T161241Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
