 appliances\, almost anything can be purchased and delivered to your home. 
  We teach you how to find goods and services   online\, look for customer 
 reviews or consumer testing results and provide   tips and guidelines on h
 ow to shop safely\, securely and with confidence.   Resource handout provi
 ded.\nPrerequisite: Basic Mouse and Keyboarding Skills Required
