DESCRIPTION:This month's movie:\nRule Breakers\nThis movie is rated PG\nIn
  a nation where educating girls is seen as rebellion\, a visionary woman d
 ares to teach young minds to dream. When their innovation draws global att
 ention\, their success sparks hope--and opposition. As threats loom and sa
 crifices are made\, their courage and unity ignite a movement that could f
 orever transform the world.
