DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T193000
SUMMARY:Music on the River (ft. Wax Mannequin)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJoin is
  in jamming to tunes from a artist Wax Mannequin! To book your spot\, plea
 se go to the link:\n*[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-sh
 ows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows
 -on-the-river/)*\nLink shows live boat availability and options!\n\nLocate
 d on Toronto’s beautiful Humber River our Music On The River event start
 s at our Humber Paddling centre which is only a 5-Minute walk from Old Mil
 l TTC Station! Upon arrival we’ll get you signed in and set you up with 
 your boat and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of the mea
 ndering Humber River before enjoying a 45-Minute set from Popular Local To
 ronto Artists!\n\n***Events are subject to weather and other factors out o
 f our control. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let you know as
  soon as possible.***\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://torontoadventu
 res.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures
 .ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/)\nSingle Kayak (seats 1 perso
 n) : $49.95 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nRegular
  Canoe (seats 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $9
 9.95 +taxes\nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nSeat in a Vo
 yageur Canoe (1 person) : $39.95 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat (boat/equipme
 nt): $9.95 +taxes\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD
 (s) “Lifejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Our experienced 
 staff to help you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress 
 for the weather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all recommended fo
 r sunny days!\n* We recommend securely fastened footwear (footwear is not 
 required for SUPs).\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the show\n* Snacks 
 & Drinks (Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget your Cameras!\n\n**[Google Link
  Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocation)
 **\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation
 )**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)\n\nWe hope to see y
 ou out on the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/315255820/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260614T150613Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260614T150613Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
