SUMMARY: Comedy X Storytelling's LTT! "Up to the Challenge"
DESCRIPTION:Listen To This! is a unique comedy storytelling show in downt
 own Toronto featuring some of the city's most talented storytellers and c
 omedians telling funny stories on a different theme each month.\n\nThis m
 onth performers share hilarious\, true stories about taking on tough chal
 lenges.\n\nThis show challenges our performers to step out of their comfo
 rt zone and combine performance styles in a way that celebrates the best 
 aspects of both stand-up comedy and personal storytelling. This leads to 
 some incredible stories\, hilarious jokes\, and unexpected moments that's
  unlike other storytelling and comedy shows.\n\nThis month's performers i
 nclude: Anna Penner\, Bee Bertrand\, Karin Fekko\, Preeya Malik\, Randall
  Willis\, Tahna\, and Michael Salvatore.\n\nFri\, Sept 25th @ 7PM\n\nFree
