DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun tree themed story time and craft! This 
 program will teach kids all about the tree candidates for this year’s Ki
 ds Vote Weekend.\nFor families with kids age 4-8.\nRegistration is require
 d.\nPlease only register the children that will be participating\, accompa
 nying adults do not need to register.\nToronto's municipal election takes 
 place on October 26\, 2026. Check out the\nKnowYourVote.TO\nwebsite and th
 e\nCelebrate Democracy\npage to learn more about the upcoming election\, a
 ccess important voter resources\, and discover activities and interactive 
 library programs for all ages happening at a branch near you.\nThis initia
 tive is made possible by donations to the Toronto Public Library Foundatio
 n and is generously supported by the McConnell Foundation.\nInformation Co
 llection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by th
 e Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\,
  20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and progra
 m registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library 
