 e@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.\nAccess
 ibility\nLive or automated closed captioning\, sign language interpretatio
 n\, intervenor services\, or attendant services are available upon request
 . Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to:\ntpl.ca/acces
 sibility-events\n.
