SUMMARY:Health Toronto | Sept 28\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:TechTO\n**This is a paid event. You must register and have a t
 icket to attend.** 👉 **[Health Toronto - Sept 28](https://luma.com/heal
 th-toronto-september-28-2026)**\n\n**Health Toronto - the hard calls behin
 d building in Canadian healthcare.**\n\nCanadian healthcare is one of the 
 hardest spaces to build in\, and it's rarely built alone. Where to build\,
  when to partner\, when to sell\, what happens to your edge when AI lets i
 ncumbents build it in-house\, how to earn trust in Canada's most regulated
  markets - you won't find these answers in a deck.\nHear them straight fro
 m founders\, clinicians\, and operators who've spent years making these ex
 act calls.\n**You'll leave with:**\n\n* Real conversations with founders n
 avigating regulation\, funding\, and clinical trust\n* Practical insights 
 you can use before your next fundraise or launch\n* A room of 200+ tech pr
 ofessionals building in Canada's healthcare space\n\n📅 Monday\\\, Septe
 mber 28 \\| 6PM\\- 9PM\n📍 GreenShield Toronto\n🎟️ Paid event \\- t
 ickets required \\| Free for TechTO Members\n\n**Register via Luma:** [htt
 ps://luma.com/health-toronto-september-28-2026](https://luma.com/health-to
 ronto-september-28-2026)
