SUMMARY:Introduction to 3D Printing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T190000
UID:6a90a1aa37716d0d1ad6faf0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how 3D printers work and how you can print at the Toront
 o Public Library’s Digital Innovation Hubs.\nThis is an in person event 
 intended for ages 13+. Drop-in with no registration required.\nNote: Cust
 omers are no longer required to attend a mandatory 3D printing class prior
  to using a 3D printer at the Toronto Public Library’s Digital Innovatio
 n Hubs. This class is for those who are interested in learning more about 
 3D printing and how to use the Prusa software.
