DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T200000
UID:6a84e002fa71a30d9294608b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively discussion of\nVioleta\nby Isabel Allende
 .  Copies available for pickup at the Annette Branch.  The title is also
  available as an eBook or eAudiobook on LibbyOverdrive - search tpl.ca or
  ask us at the desk.\nThe Annette Book Club meets on the last Tuesday of e
 very month.  New attendees are always welcome! Drop-in\, no registration
  required.\nVioleta
LOCATION:Annette Street
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a84e002fa71a30d9294608b
