DESCRIPTION:Address:\nThe Creative School\, Toronto Metropolitan Universit
 y\nTRS 1-003 (7th Floor)\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nWe're on the path to a n
 ew kind of web\, with an uncertain future: AI-based user agents are fast-b
 ecoming a core interface to the internet. Platforms have increasingly seiz
 ed control of the publisher-reader relationship: search engines are squeez
 ing out web publishers to juice ad revenue\, while social platforms have c
 aptured audiences with algorithmic reach and paid promotion.\nHow can publ
 ishers engage in this platform shift beyond being a dataset to be scraped?
  How can we avoid being trapped by a new wave of mega-platforms? And how c
 an publishers on the web reach real users\, build lasting…\n\nHosted by 
 Team PfP✨
LOCATION:The Creative School\, Toronto Metropolitan University\, 80 Gould 
 St\, Toronto\, ON M5B 2M7\, Canada
