DESCRIPTION:Digital Inclusion Week: October 4th\, 2026 - October 10th\, 20
 26\nAre you interested in how to navigate the internet on your personal de
 vices with improved privacy\, as well as understanding the importance of s
 taying safe using the internet? If so\, this is the class for you. Learn t
 o develop strong passwords and review the best methods for storing your pa
 sswords.\nCome and join us in this introductory session that is filled wit
 h hands-on activities and discussion.\nPre-requisites: Some computer exper
 ience is required.
