DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T160000
UID:6a99d27f60ccaf01c02333a7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to conduct market research for your business plan us
 ing databases available through the Toronto Public Library. Discover how t
 o find industry reports and information on potential competitors\, market 
 trends\, and customer demographics.\nBasic keyboarding and mouse skills re
 quired.\nDrop-ins will be accepted starting at\n2:05 PM\n.\nSlots for regi
 strants will be released to drop-in customers\, 5 minutes after the event
  start time (past\n2:05 PM\n).\nThis program takes place during\nDigital I
 nclusion Week 2026.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, e-Learning Lab\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99d27f60ccaf01c02333a7
