SUMMARY:Canva: Graphic Design & Layout
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T153000
UID:6aa315b2f9ed2e00384fab28@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Canva is a free-to-use online graphic design tool. Use it to c
 reate social media posts\, presentations\, posters\, videos\, logos and mo
 re.\nEasily create eye catching business cards and flyers. Use Canva's dra
 g-and-drop feature and professional layouts to design consistently stunnin
 g graphics. Create polished work using different templates and techniques 
 that make your creations pop.\nDesign presentations\, social media graphic
 s\, and more with thousands of beautiful layouts.\nIt has everything you n
 eed for amazing design:\nMillions of Stock Images\, Photo Filters\, Free I
 cons & Shapes\, and Hundreds of Fonts.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Learning Centre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa315b2f9ed2e00384fab28
