DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261008T150000
UID:6aa18eba8cf597003f9247a0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Digital Inclusion Week: October 4th\, 2026 - October 10th\, 20
 26\nBuild on your basic Microsoft Word skills and learn to use Word more e
 ffectively.\nIn this class\, you will:\nPractice new Word skills while you
  design a flyer\nFormat text\, margins\, indents\, headers and footers\nFo
 rmat text as columns\nCreate bulleted\, numbered and sorted lists\nReview 
 your document with Spelling and Grammar check and Thesaurus\nUpon completi
 on of this class\, you will be able to use even more Word tools to design 
 your documents.\nPrerequisites:  Word Basics 1 or equivalent skills. Basic
  keyboarding and mouse skills required.\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstrati
 ons\nThe program will take place in the Auditorium located in the basement
 . Elevator on site. If you have any questions\, please call Bendale Branch
  at 416-396-8910.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informatio
 n on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public
  Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will 
 only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation.
  Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed 
 to Answerline staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street
 \, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Bendale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa18eba8cf597003f9247a0
