UID:6a85ce7f2cbfe80d71a475cf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come bring a book you are reading. We read for 30-45 minutes a
 nd then everyone talks about what they have read. We meet the second Thurs
 day of every month from 7:00 to 8:00 pm.
