DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261015T200000
UID:6aa5adf4ca248a002915606e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get your spook on with our scary movie screening of "The Fly" 
 (1986)\, directed by David Cronenberg.\nA cult classic from a Canadian dir
 ector (and shot in Toronto!)\, "The Fly" is a sci-fi body-horror film abou
 t an eccentric scientist and an experiment gone horribly wrong. "The Fly"
  has a running time of 96 minutes and was rated 'R' by the MPAA for depic
 tions of violence. This is an 18+ program\, viewer discretion advised.\nTh
 ere will be a short introduction to the film followed by the screening\, w
 hich will be accompanied by closed captions.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, B/C
