DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T180000
UID:6a91c8f569166f088b959a50@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Cozy up by the fire and enjoy a movie with friends.\nAre we wa
 tching an action-packed adventure\, a cheesy rom-com\, or an uproariously 
 funny comedy? Vote for your favourite movie in the Youth Hub. We’ll show
  the film with the most votes.\nThis is a drop-in Youth Hub program for\nt
 eens only.\nNo registration required.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub s
 ervice. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the
  summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious sna
 cks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the br
 anch to find out more.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a91c8f569166f088b959a50
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
