 ement: This show is All Ages! Cast: Sucka Queen &amp\; Guests! Get ready f
 or a one-of-a-kind Drag Brunch experience at The Royal Sonesta! Expect hig
 h-energy drag performances\, delicious food and drinks\, and fabulous priz
 es! Doors open at 11:30am! 💸 Please remember to bring cash to tip the p
 erformers! 🪑 Communal seating – purchase tickets in groups to be seat
 ed together or reach out to us to coordinate tables! Get your tickets now 
 – seats fill up fast! ‍
