 ll journey through the intricate art of Turkish mosaic design\, taking a c
 lose look at exquisite examples of decorative patterns as well as diverse 
 glass lamps. In this workshop\, you will explore traditional techniques an
 d the cultural significance of light in Islamic art as you create your own
  personalized mosaic candle holder.
