 coupage Trinket Boxes\nWednesday\, October 14: Perler Beads\nWednesday\, O
 ctober 21: Custom Knit Beanies\nWednesday\, October 28: Spooky Charm Brace
 lets\nWednesdays in October\, 3:30 - 7 pm\nThis program is part of Youth H
 ub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in
