SUMMARY: Art on A Tuesday/Show Friday's
DESCRIPTION:Art on a Tuesday returns to Toronto on Friday\, October 23 fo
 r an intimate\, curated night of live entertainment\, art\, food and conn
 ection.\n\nTaking place at Half Note 416 in Scarborough\, the evening bri
 ngs multiple forms of entertainment together under one roof — live R&B\, 
 comedy\, magic and mentalism\, spoken word\, violin\, visual art\, featur
 ed creatives and DJs.\n\nThe October 23 lineup includes comedians Sai Kit
  Lo and Moe Ismail\, magician and mentalist Francisco Perez\, R&B singer 
 Rose SHIKU\, violinist Daniela Olano\, spoken word artist Marie-Lauren Gr
 egoire Drummond (MLG)\, along with featured visual artists and creatives.
 \n\nCome early\, grab dinner and drinks\, explore the art\, meet people a
 nd settle in for a show designed to keep the night moving from one experi
 ence to the next.\n\nFriday\, October 23\, 2026\nHalf Note 416 — 3357 Kin
 gston Road\, Toronto\nDoors: 6:30 PM | Show: 8:30 PM | Ends: 10:45 PM\n\n
 It’s not a concert. It’s not the club. It’s an intimate\, curated night o
 f art\, entertainment and connection — designed to keep the dopamine flow
 ing.
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Spoken-Word/Poetry,Art-Show/Gallery-Event,Half-Note-416
