 ront Trail as we set off from Stonehooker Brewery in Port Credit in Missis
 sauga to Sunnyside Park Café for coffee\, then make our way back to Stone
 hooker Brewery via Mississauga’s newest conservation area – ‘Jim Tov
 ey Park’. This is a new 26 hectare waterfront park at the shore of Lake 
