BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Torontobotanicalgarden": "https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/autumn-watercolour-workshop-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:torontobotanicalgarden
X-SOURCE:Toronto Botanical Garden
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T160000
DTSTAMP:20260913T003702
CREATED:20260825T154716Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260825T154729Z
UID:10002020-1792846800-1792857600@torontobotanicalgarden.ca
SUMMARY:Autumn Watercolour Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the beauty of autumn with this beginner-friendly watercolour workshop!\nExplore the transparency and fluidity of watercolour while capturing the beauty of fall foliage. Bring your own favourite leaves or choose from samples provided by the facilitator\, and learn techniques for colour application\, blending and harmonizing. Create beautiful seasonal leaf studies to take home and enjoy.\n \nBeginners welcome. All materials are included.\n \nSaturday\, October 24\, 1 to 4 p.m.\nPublic $45\, TBG Members $35 (plus applicable taxes and fees).\n \nAbout Linda Borris\nLinda is a Toronto-based artist\, specializing in watercolour painting techniques. She focuses on her interests in botanical studies and constantly strives to discover interesting ways to portray her work. Linda’s painting compositions depict her particular attention to detail. Her art generally consists of bright\, bold colours and forms. Mostly working with florals\, Linda occasionally completes a fun landscape. Her paintings’ subject matter are usually taken from her own photography images. Linda loves to share her enjoyment in the lively and vibrant world of botanical essences. Her art can be seen in both group exhibits and separate venues.\n \nShe is a member of the Beach Guild of Fine Art and former member of Botanical Artists of Canada.\n \nAlso visit Linda’s work on Instagram: @watercolourslinda\n \nJoin Toronto Botanical Garden\n \nJoin the Toronto Botanical Garden (TBG) as a member to get a discount on this program\, upcoming events and classes\, and free parking. A TBG membership helps you deepen your knowledge and connection to the natural world\, become a part of a dynamic community of plant people\, and be inspired! Become a member!\n \nAdditional Program Information\n\n\n\nPlease review our Refund Policy and Terms of Agreement.\nFor more information on accessibility at the garden please review our Accessibility Features webpage. If you have any accessibility requirements during your program please email programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca.\nTo learn more about the Toronto Botanical Garden and our programs\, please review our list of Frequently Asked Questions.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/autumn-watercolour-workshop-2/
LOCATION:Toronto Botanical Garden\, 777 Lawrence Ave E\, Toronto\, ON\, M3C 1P2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bbc0f6750bc77f77e35f7d6f315cd28d.jpg
END:VEVENT
