UID:6aa048e93b6c71003e5e85b2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking to expand your circle of book loving friends?
  Join us for an afternoon of speedy discussion to make new friends at the 
 library! Lightning rounds of pairs will meet potential new friends and hav
 e interesting bookish conversations. Whether you are a fan of the classics
 \, love the excitement of a thriller\, or prefer literary fiction\, this e
 vent is a great opportunity to make connections with people who have a sha
 red love of reading.\nTea and cookies will be served.\nSpaces are limited\
 , so please register to guarantee a spot.\nInformation Collection Notice:\
 nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public 
