 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization.\nThis month we will be joined by 41 Division Neig
 hbourhood Community Officers\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all
  participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Front Entrance
