DESCRIPTION:Are you an avid reader? If reading more is one of your goals t
 his year\, then the Teen Book Club might be the place for you. Every month
  we will read a book that aligns with TPL’s Reading Challenge for an add
 ed twist! When the year is finished\, enter the contest\, or simply be pro
 ud of yourself for reading. Pick up your physical copy in the Youth Hub\, 
 check out an e-book or e-audiobook online at tpl.ca\, or simply join us 
 to talk about all things bookish.\nAll teens are welcome! The title for th
 is month is\nThe Surprising Power of a Good Dumpling by Wai Chim.\nThis pr
 ogram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for t
