DESCRIPTION:Learn about cold-blooded critters and get your chance to hold 
 an adult boa constrictor! Ask your snake-related question and take some p
 ictures with some new animal friends!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub s
 ervice. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the
  summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious sna
 cks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the br
 anch to find out more.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, 2nd Floor Youth Hub
