SUMMARY:Reading Challenge Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T190000
UID:6a904dc058433600542b83d6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Locke's Book Club\, where we will explore titles f
 rom categories of the\n2026 Reading Challenge\n.\nConnect with other read
 ers\, dive deeper into this year's categories through meaningful discussio
 n\, and learn about titles and formats you may not normally read. Each Boo
 k Club session will be facilitated by our staff\, who will provide a list 
 of titles you can choose for each month\, based on a category from TPL's 
 2026 Reading Challenge.\nCategory for October:\n1960-1969\nCategory for No
 vember:\nWarm Weather\nCategory for December:\nWrap-up party! All categori
 es welcome.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on t
 his form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libra
 ries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only b
 e used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Quest
 ions about how the library handles your information can be directed to Ans
 werline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, 
 Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Locke\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a904dc058433600542b83d6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
