 group is led by editor and author\nSharon A. Crawford\n.\nDrop In\, No reg
 istration required.\nIn-Person Program for Adults and Seniors.\nMeets on t
 he 4\nth\nWednesday of the Month\n(No meeting in Aug or Dec)\n2026 Meeting
  dates:\nJanuary 28\nFebruary 25\nMarch 25\nApril 22\nMay 27\nJune 24\nJul
 y 22\nSeptember 23\nOctober 28\nNovember 25
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Meeting Room
