UID:6971158a992fc18a86dead94@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program offers adults a space to relax and reconnect with
  their creativity\, enjoying the process at their own pace.\nThere is no c
 lass\, formal instruction\n\,\nor need for experience\n. Various supplies 
 including colouring sheets will be provided.\nLOCATIONS:\nFebruary 26\n(Ro
 om 1)\nMarch 26\n(Room 1)\nApril 30\n(eLearning Lab)\nMay 28\n(Room 2/3)\n
 June 25\n(Room 2/3)\nJuly 30\n(Room 1)\nAugust 27\n(Room 1)\nSeptember 24\
 n(Room 1)\nOctober 29\n(Room 1)\nNovember 26\n(Room 1)
