DESCRIPTION:Navigating self-employment in a new country can be challenging
 \, but this workshop will equip newly immigrated entrepreneurs (and new en
 trepreneurs in general) with the essential financial tools to succeed in 
 Canada. This workshop is designed to build your confidence in managing you
 r business finances and help you thrive as a self-employed professional in
  Canada. Perfect for newcomers looking to establish a solid financial foun
 dation.​\nRegistration required.\nInformation Collection Notice: The per
 sonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library 
 under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The i
