BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8f51104cb69d003e2398cf"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Blatant Injustice The Internment of Jewish Refugees in Canada duri
 ng World War II
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T193000
UID:6a8f51104cb69d003e2398cf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Author Ian Darragh talks about his book chronicling the harrow
 ing experiences of Jewish refugees to Canada\, who were treated as enemies
  and imprisoned in internment camps during World War II. Yet the internees
 \, who were Holocaust survivors\, did not let the authorities crush their 
 spirit. Blatant Injustice is a story of resilience and determination.
LOCATION:Yorkville
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8f51104cb69d003e2398cf
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3e8cc6414ef43d00981be3"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Quilting Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T200000
UID:6a3e8cc6414ef43d00981be3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The focus of this program is to make quilts for donation\, usi
 ng fabrics that have been donated to the group for this purpose.\nParticip
 ants meet weekly to share ideas and inspiration while working on quilts. T
 here are no sewing machines at the library so any sewing is done by hand. 
 Most participants also work on quilts using their own sewing machine at ho
 me. Quilts are completed both as individual projects and as group collabor
 ations.\nNew members are welcome\, and will have access to the instruction
 s\, fabrics\, needle and thread required to contribute on-site to the curr
 ent group project.\nRegarding dates: The quilters will not meet when schoo
 l is out. E.g. March break and during the summer (July and August) and dur
 ing December break.
LOCATION:Jones
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3e8cc6414ef43d00981be3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
