DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T120000
UID:69401bd0d875af6300d0d172@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all part
 icipants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.
LOCATION:Parliament Street
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69401bd0d875af6300d0d172
