DESCRIPTION:Join us once a month on a Tuesday\, at the Malvern Library fo
 r our Senior Social.\nEnjoy trivia\, bingo\, coffee and relaxed conversati
 on in a welcoming and friendly space. Discover library resources and progr
 ams\, connect with community services and meet new people.\nCome socialize
 \, learn something new\, and have fun!\nRegistration required.\nUpcoming D
 ates (Tuesday):\nSept 8\, 2026\nOct 13\, 2026\nNov 10\, 2026\nDec 8\, 2026
