DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T123000
UID:6a8df994aafa6100295f13e9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Practice English weekly in a small group setting with support 
 from CultureLink’s mentors and:\n•	Speak with confidence\n•	Make new
  friends\n•	Network and share experiences\n•	Learn about Canada\nCutur
 eLink is solely responsible for the protection of personal information col
 lected through the program registration process.
