UID:69498364111b9da65ca88212@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn about quality community resources for young families\, 
 enjoy a circle time for the young ones\, and get some nutritious snacks.
 \nSuitable for families with children birth to six years old.\nIn partners
 hip with EarlyON Child and Family Centre of Regent Park Community Health C
 entre.
