UID:6a7259d3614a3e1aa9b6d7ad@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every third Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nAugust 18\, 202
 6 -\nUnorthodox by Deborah Feldman\nSeptember 15\, 2026 –\nThe History o
 f Love by Nicole Krauss\nOctober 20\, 2026 –\nPaper Girl by Beth Macy\nN
 ovember 17\, 2026 –\nRun Towards the Danger by Sarah Polley\nCopies of t
 he book are available for borrowing at the Fairview Library.\nDrop-in\, no
  registration necessary.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7259d3614a3e1aa9b6d7ad
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
