DESCRIPTION:This is a program for parents and caregivers with children fro
 m birth - 6 years. Families have the opportunity to socialize while childr
 en develop new skills in an early learning environment.\nThis program is o
 ffered in partnership with the\nMalvern Family Resource Centre (MFRC)\n.\n
 This is a drop-in program. No registration required.
LOCATION:Woodside Square\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a970e821c197d11325c69df
