UID:6a84969a2dac6e00371ff049@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for stories\, songs\, rhymes and activities for childr
 en ages 5 and under and their parents or caregivers. Children\, parents an
 d caregivers are invited for Stay and Play from 11:00am to 11:30am.\nAcces
 sibility\nLive or automated closed captioning\, sign language interpretati
 on\, intervenor services\, or attendant services are available upon reques
 t. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to:\ntpl.ca/acce
 ssibility-events\n.
