X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_bicycling_network
SUMMARY:City Walk - (Thursday - Tentative) Location to be Determined (Fall
  2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T120000
UID:3594dcf00a7e6e3a467da7968f6d1c7b@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:We tentatively plan on having a City Walk on this date. The st
 art location\, route and other information will be determined after the Ci
 ty Walk Planning Meeting (in August\, September\, or October). We will mee
 t at about 10:00 AM at a location to be determined\, and the walk will beg
 in at 10:10. We have introduced a 30-Day-Trial membership class which allo
 ws "guests" to participate in most activities over the span of a 1-month p
 eriod. We are accepting Guest registrations. If you have not registered fo
 r the walk\, you may NOT join the walk. If you have registered but can't a
 ttend\, log in\, click on "Already registered"\, then cancel. Please check
  the website 2 hours before the start time\, in the unl...
LOCATION:a location to be determined\, and the walk will begin at 10:10
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/event-6594614
X-SOURCE:Toronto Bicycling Network
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa1a68d65abe8002a77dd12"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_adults
SUMMARY:Sanko Speaks: Drop In Thursdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T140000
UID:6aa1a68d65abe8002a77dd12@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A free\, culturally affirming drop-in program for adults that 
 promotes mental wellness through creative activities\, discussion\, and he
 althy coping strategies. Guided by the concept of Sankofa\, participants e
 xplore connections between past experiences and present wellbeing while bu
 ilding skills for managing stress and supporting mental health. Activities
  vary based on community interests and needs.\nThis program is in collabor
 ation with TAIBU Community Health Centre.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Small Meeting Room\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa1a68d65abe8002a77dd12
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
