X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Preschool": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a83830f3b6c71003e5989d4"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_preschool
SUMMARY:Toddler Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T113000
UID:6a83830f3b6c71003e5989d4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for stories\, songs and rhymes in this program for chi
 ldren\, 19 months to 3 years\, and their parents or caregivers. Toddler Ti
 me runs from 10:30 to 11:00 am. Children\, parents and caregivers are inv
 ited to Stay and Play from 11:00 to 11:30 am.\nPlease select one spot for 
 each participant (child or caregiver). For example\, two children and two 
 caregivers require four reserved spots in total.\nInformation Collection N
 otice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto 
 Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, a
 nd 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program registra
 tion\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles yo
 ur information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n
