DESCRIPTION:Presented by\nRiverdale Immigrant Women’s Centre (RIWC)\n\, 
 this workshop is an introduction to long-term financial planning including
  retirement savings and better understanding of federal income benefits\, 
 such as\, Canada Pension Plan (CPP) and Old Age Security (OAS).\nRegistrat
 ion encouraged\n. Drop-ins are welcome until capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 1\, 2nd floor
