 ouse) are most welcome to join us.\n\n This is intended  to be a social 
 evening\, where food is ordered\, while the evening is spent playing board
  games\, card games\, or even some of the video games setup at Hacklab. ..
 . Where the "Bring Your Own" format is everyone arranging to either bring 
