 th! November's book is Crook Manifesto by Colson Whitehead. Pick up your 
 book at the front desk! Registration is required and copies are limited. P
 lease place a copy of the book on hold if our branch does not have an avai
 lable copy.\nForest Hill will have limited copies of the month's title 6 
 weeks prior to the date of the book club.\nUpcoming Books:\nJune 25:\nEver
 ything I never told you about\nJuly/August: Break\nSeptember 24:\nBroken 
 Country\nOctober 29:\nLost Lady\nNovember 26:\nCrook Manifesto
