DESCRIPTION:Play Dungeons and Dragons!  Slay monsters and overcome challen
 ges with a Librarian as your Dungeon Master.\nOngoing Campaign.  This is a
 n in-person program for\nTeens\n.  Space limited for players*\, but watche
 rs are welcome too.  All supplies provided.  Bring a 1st level character o
 r pick a Pre-generated character.\n*Register in-person at the Youth Hub at
  3:30PM.\nFridays\, 4:00-5:30PM\nOctober 2\nOctober 23\nNovember 27
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a42791ac52cdc3600ed9649
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
