SUMMARY:Financial Literacy & Tax Management for Entrepreneurs & Newcomer E
 ntrepreneurs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261128T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261128T140000
UID:6aa0536e648f481be43adc08@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This workshop will support entrepreneurs by teaching them the 
 fundamental and essentials skills of small business and personal finance. 
 Tailored to their chosen careers\, participants will learn to:\nManage the
 ir self-employed finances\nKnow how much income tax & sales tax they owe t
 he CRA in real time year-round\nDo their taxes in under 10 minutes at tax 
 time\nAvoid going into debt to pay taxes.\nPlease note: *For all registere
 d Adult programs at Humberwood\, there is a grace period of 10 minutes. Af
 ter the first 10 minutes of a program\, spots will be given to waiting cus
 tomers.*
LOCATION:Humberwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa0536e648f481be43adc08
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
