DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T193000
UID:6a9c6343aafa61002961d467@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get creative and design your own personalized tote bag! Choose
  a design and use a variety of art supplies to create a unique tote bag th
 at you can take home and enjoy. All supplies are provided.\nPlease note:\n
 There is a 10-minute grace period. After the first 10 minutes of the progr
 am\, any unclaimed spots may be offered to customers on the waitlist.
LOCATION:Woodside Square
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a9c6343aafa61002961d467
