DESCRIPTION:We tentatively plan on having a City Walk on this date. The st
 art location\, route and other information will be determined after the Ci
 ty Walk Planning Meeting (in August\, September\, or October). We will mee
 t at about 10:00 AM at a location to be determined\, and the walk will beg
 in at 10:10. We have introduced a 30-Day-Trial membership class which allo
