DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261210T183000
UID:6a7b70e3d033f1003e0aa7be@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Meet Benjamin\, Artist in the Library at the Downsview Branch\
 , where you will learn the Art of Dj-ing. Every Thursday with special gues
 ts\, learn the skills required to blend\, beat match and mix tracks while 
 also learning about future career opportunities. Students will learn equip
 ment mastery\, have fun and learn how to build a brand on social media.\nT
 his event is part of the\nArtists in the Library\nprogram.\nBenjamin with 
 DJ equipment
LOCATION:Downsview\, Downstairs Auditorium
