 o provide tech help\, under the guidance of library staff. Learn the basic
 s of using computers\, tablets and smartphones and popular websites and so
 ftware.\nIf you're a teen between the ages of 13-17 and would like to lear
 n more about becoming a Seniors E-Connect volunteer\, visit the\nSeniors E
 -Connect Volunteering page\nor contact the branch.\nInformation Collection
  Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toront
 o Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\,
